  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE\n\nLeague Inc                                                                                                                                  Apr 2026 \055 Present\nSoftware Developer \050Android\051\t \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240                                                                                                             Ottawa\054 ON\nKotlin Developer working on League\031s platform SDK\054 impacting millions of users across dozens of benefits\057insurance apps\056\nBuilt Live Chat interface for connecting healthcare providers to users via League\031s AI Agents\054 and customized client solutions\056\n\nFlex Artificial Intelligence\t\t \t\t\t\t\t\240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                  Jan 2024 \023 Mar 2026\nSenior Android Engineer\t \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240                                                                                                                       Ottawa\054 ON\nLead engineer building Flex Fitness for Android\054 a workout companion \046 social media app\056\nResponsibilities included architecture\054 team management\054 agile planning\054 and DevOps\056\nEnforce usage of modern technologies\073 Kotlin\054 Jetpack Compose\054 Flow\054 Coroutines\054 MVVM\054 and Clean Architecture\056\n\nKonrad Group\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                               Sep 2018 \023 Jan 2024\nSenior Software Developer\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240 \240                                                                                                 Toronto\054 ON\nPreviously\072 Software Developer\054 Associate Software Developer\054 Software Developer Intern\nKotlin and Java developer\054 contributing to industry leading Android apps for high impact clients\056\nAmerican financial services app with 14 million users\056\nPod lead\054 responsible for end\055to\055end feature architecture\054 development and deployment\056 \nFixed critical bugs in the registration flow\054 improving sign\055up conversion rate by 5\045\056\nAt\055home workout streaming platform for a popular American fitness brand\056\nImplemented a custom OAuth flow with QR code verification\056 Deployed new system with a 100\045 crash free rate\056\nCreated an interactive \034Blur View\035 in XML\054 allowing us to blur streamed video in real time\054 while optimizing for custom hardware\056\nPlayed an active role in candidate evaluation by conducting technical interviews\056\n\n\nSKILLS\n\nLanguages\072 Kotlin\054 Javascript\054 Java\054 HTML\054 CSS\054 C\053\053\054 C\nFrameworks\072 Android\054 Jetpack Compose\054 React Native\054 Flutter\054 React\nTools\072 Git\054 Github\054 Gitlab\054 Firebase\054 Jira\054 Figma\nSkills\072 Leadership\054 Teaching\054 Communication\054 Technical Presentations\054 Machine Learning\n\n\nEDUCATION\n\nUniversity of Toronto \055 BASc\054 Computer Engineering\nMinor Certificate \055 Engineering Business and Management\nTeam member \055 Varsity Swim Team \050National Champions 2015 \055 2016\051\nFluent in French)
